            <ArticleTitle>Chondromyxoid fibroma of the ala of the sacrum presenting as a cause of lumbar pain in an adolescent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>351-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of chondromyxoid fibroma of the ala of the sacrum: its presentation, diagnosis, treatment, and resolution. Although this tumor is admittedly rare, our case demonstrates the need for careful evaluation of pack pain in an adolescent.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
